    {
      "id": "tolna-s-rift",
      "title": "Tolna's Rift",
      "anchor": "Tolna's_Rift",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Room of Rage"
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "tolna-s-rift:qtnsbv",
          "html": "Near the entrance is a set of weapons.",
          "text": "Near the entrance is a set of weapons.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "tolna-s-rift:10htcea",
          "html": "Only these weapons will defeat the monsters in this room. Different weapons kill different monsters. Kill monsters until the rage meter at the top of the screen is full. Certain equipment will not allow progress. To be safe, un-equip all gear except the anger weapons.",
          "text": "Only these weapons will defeat the monsters in this room. Different weapons kill different monsters. Kill monsters until the rage meter at the top of the screen is full. Certain equipment will not allow progress. To be safe, un-equip all gear except the anger weapons.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "tolna-s-rift:10htcea:9di8gu",
              "html": "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Anger_sword\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anger sword</a> - kills <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Angry_unicorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Angry unicorn</a>",
              "text": "Anger sword - kills Angry unicorn",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "tolna-s-rift:10htcea:19nlogk",
              "html": "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Anger_spear\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anger spear</a> - kills <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Angry_bear\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Angry bear</a>",
              "text": "Anger spear - kills Angry bear",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "tolna-s-rift:10htcea:1qbmiyy",
              "html": "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Anger_maul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anger maul</a> - kills <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Angry_giant_rat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Angry giant rat</a>",
              "text": "Anger maul - kills Angry giant rat",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "tolna-s-rift:10htcea:1h19ku0",
              "html": "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Anger_battleaxe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Anger battleaxe</a> - kills <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Angry_goblin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Angry goblin</a>",
              "text": "Anger battleaxe - kills Angry goblin",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "tolna-s-rift:ya21er",
          "html": "Watch the short cutscene.",
          "text": "Watch the short cutscene.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "tolna-s-rift:1bz46xe",
          "html": "<i>Enter</i> the exit to the east to proceed.",
          "text": "Enter the exit to the east to proceed.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Room of Fear"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "You need to kill the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fear_reaper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">fear reaper</a> 5 times in order to proceed."
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "tolna-s-rift:1r03774",
          "html": "&#39;Look-inside&#39; a dark hole, if the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Fear_reaper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">fear reaper</a> does not show up right away move onto the next hole that has the &#39;look-inside&#39; option. Move around the room in a clock-wise rotation until the fear reaper has been killed 5 times.",
          "text": "'Look-inside' a dark hole, if the fear reaper does not show up right away move onto the next hole that has the 'look-inside' option. Move around the room in a clock-wise rotation until the fear reaper has been killed 5 times.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "tolna-s-rift:tbugc5",
          "html": "Continue the process until you receive a cutscene.",
          "text": "Continue the process until you receive a cutscene.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "tolna-s-rift:1tzk9be",
          "html": "After the cutscene, <i>Enter</i> the black hole on the west wall to proceed.",
          "text": "After the cutscene, Enter the black hole on the west wall to proceed.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Room of Confusion"
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "tolna-s-rift:1ss9aa6",
          "html": "Start attacking a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Confusion_beast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">confusion beast</a>, if you do not deal any damage immediately move onto another beast until you find the one that takes damage.",
          "text": "Start attacking a confusion beast, if you do not deal any damage immediately move onto another beast until you find the one that takes damage.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "tolna-s-rift:1ss9aa6:jzwskh",
              "html": "Any <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Confusion_beast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">confusion beast</a> that you hit will continue to attack you, if you are low combat it is advised to continue hitting a beast until it goes away.",
              "text": "Any confusion beast that you hit will continue to attack you, if you are low combat it is advised to continue hitting a beast until it goes away.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "tolna-s-rift:xdr60f",
          "html": "Find and kill the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Confusion_beast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">confusion beast</a> 5 times in total in order to proceed.",
          "text": "Find and kill the confusion beast 5 times in total in order to proceed.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "tolna-s-rift:1iwi3ey",
          "html": "After all beasts have been killed enter the remaining <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Confusing_door\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">confusing door</a> for a cutscene.",
          "text": "After all beasts have been killed enter the remaining confusing door for a cutscene.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Room of Hopelessness"
        },
        {
          "type": "note",
          "html": "<b>Warning</b>: after all 5 creatures have been killed the screen will turn white and briefly flash."
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "tolna-s-rift:9q03yc",
          "html": "Kill each of the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Hopeless_creature\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">hopeless creatures</a> 3 times.",
          "text": "Kill each of the hopeless creatures 3 times.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "tolna-s-rift:9q03yc:1n709ib",
              "html": "Eating food will cause the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Hopeless_creature\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">hopeless creature</a> to restore 75% of their life points.",
              "text": "Eating food will cause the hopeless creature to restore 75% of their life points.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "tolna-s-rift:d3mnx1",
          "html": "Cross the bridge and &#39;Use&#39; the exit to proceed.",
          "text": "Cross the bridge and 'Use' the exit to proceed.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "tolna",
      "title": "Tolna",
      "anchor": "Tolna",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "A cutscene will trigger, if you interrupt the cutscene in any way you will be sent to the surface and you will have to reenter the rift."
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "tolna:15zz3a",
          "html": "Kill all three of <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Tolna_(monster)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tolna&#39;s</a> heads.",
          "text": "Kill all three of Tolna's heads.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "tolna:jfptkk",
          "html": "Talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Tolna\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Tolna</a>.",
          "text": "Talk to Tolna.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "tolna:jfptkk:18ayktv",
              "html": "If he doesn&#39;t spawn, exit the room and re-enter.",
              "text": "If he doesn't spawn, exit the room and re-enter.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "tolna:75124x",
          "html": "On the surface, talk to Tolna again.",
          "text": "On the surface, talk to Tolna again.",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "tolna:fvxipr",
          "html": "Quest complete!",
          "text": "Quest complete!",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": []
        }
      ]
    }
